<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en" class="inter_2fe1ab3d-module__-T-KAq__variable"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/10770u84dg022.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/25kvgcvbp6c14.js"/><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0whst30gugz1h.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2iclhnyxlva4k.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3wc_kxht-4htf.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/turbopack-3l8baq9s849ol.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0u7zill1jxtpk.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2ojyo53ifraca.js" async=""></script><meta name="theme-color" content="#0b211c"/><meta name="color-scheme" content="light"/><title>Riemann zeta function — at least 67.35% of zeros on the critical line</title><meta name="description" content="A machine-checked record of the largest proven proportion of nontrivial Riemann zeta zeros on the critical line. New results are submitted as Lean proofs and rechecked before they are published."/><meta name="application-name" content="Riemann zeta function"/><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"/><meta name="keywords" content="Riemann zeta,Lean 4,formal verification,analytic number theory,critical line"/><meta property="og:title" content="Riemann zeta function — critical-line bound record"/><meta property="og:description" content="The current record for the proportion of Riemann zeta zeros proven to lie on the critical line, verified in Lean and open to new submissions."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://www.riemannzeta.fun"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="Riemann zeta function"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://www.riemannzeta.fun/opengraph-image?48867ad1e444a868"/